Box shadow lists interpolate shadow by shadow in animations and transitions, the shorter list padded with
transparent zero shadows (CSS Backgrounds 3 §7.2); an inset paired with an outer shadow swaps discretely.
Two lengths of different units resolve both sides, not the first twice.

